@startuml
title UC-06 - Country exposure on the free plan

autonumber

actor User
participant ETFExposureTool
participant FinnhubMarketDataClient
participant AlphaVantageAdapter
participant HoldingCountryResolver
participant FinnhubAdapter
participant ExposureCalculator

User -> ETFExposureTool : GEO QQQ
ETFExposureTool -> FinnhubMarketDataClient : getCountryExposure(QQQ)

alt Published country report is returned
    FinnhubMarketDataClient --> ETFExposureTool : country weights
    ETFExposureTool -> ExposureCalculator : calculateReportedCountryExposure
    ExposureCalculator --> User : published fund countries
else Free plan returns HTTP 403
    FinnhubMarketDataClient --> ETFExposureTool : MarketDataException
    ETFExposureTool -> AlphaVantageAdapter : getEtfProfile(QQQ)
    AlphaVantageAdapter --> ETFExposureTool : holdings
    loop At most 25 largest holdings
        ETFExposureTool -> HoldingCountryResolver : apply(profile, lookup)
        HoldingCountryResolver -> FinnhubAdapter : headquarters country
        FinnhubAdapter --> HoldingCountryResolver : country or unknown
    end
    ETFExposureTool -> ExposureCalculator : calculateGeographicExposure
    ExposureCalculator --> User : headquarters countries, with a note
end

note right of HoldingCountryResolver
  Headquarters of reported holdings.
  Not the fund's published country report
  and not revenue exposure.
  Missing profiles stay Unknown.
  Unassigned weight is named, not invented.
  Provider errors are redacted before display.
end note

@enduml
